WEBVTT

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.199
They don't compromise.

00:07:30.199 --> 00:07:33.639
They don't let one group
or one individual dominate,

00:07:33.639 --> 00:07:38.000
even if it's the boss,
even if it's the expert.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.839
Instead, they have developed

00:07:39.839 --> 00:07:43.399
a rather patient and more inclusive
decision making process

00:07:43.399 --> 00:07:47.079
that allows for both/and
solutions to arise

00:07:47.079 --> 00:07:49.879
and not simply either/or solutions.

00:07:49.879 --> 00:07:53.879
These three capabilities are why we see

00:07:53.879 --> 00:07:58.240
that Pixar is able to do what it does.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.209
Let me give you another example,